  "steps": [
   {
    "text": "Scheduled start (TMC / TAC, single instance, interval TBD). Open cnx_PAS (read only) and cnx_ELIPS (auto-commit OFF) from context variables; no credentials in logs. Insert ielp.LOG_ITGPAS (inferred) (START); log message no. 1.",
    "children": [
     "PAS connection error: log message no. 2; ELIPS connection error: log message no. 3. Stop."
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "Read pending SAs from ielp.SA_DETAIL: PAS_PR_NUMBER or PAS_PO_NUMBER empty, SA interfaced to PAS (condition TBD - Requires ELIPS table/column confirmation), SA date within CB_LOOKBACK_DAYS; group by SA number (SA_CODE: TBD - Requires ELIPS table/column confirmation).",
    "children": [
     "None: log message no. 4; go to step 9."
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "Per chunk of CB_CHUNK_SIZE SA numbers: SELECT TB_R_PR_H (PR_NO, PR_DESC, PR_NOTES) WHERE PR_DESC IN (chunk) LEFT JOIN <PAS_PO_PR_LINK> LEFT JOIN TB_R_PO_H with <PO_STATUS_COL> = '44' (TBD - Requires PAS table/column confirmation). Mode B (optional): released POs since the watermark.",
    "children": [
     "Chunk error: log message no. 5."
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "Classify each row (Functional Description 4.1): PR not found, PO not released, PR_NOTES NULL / empty, PR_NOTES not ending '0', or ELIGIBLE. PR_NOTES only via RTRIM / RIGHT / LEN, so no format can fail the job.",
    "children": [
     "log message no. 6; log message no. 7; log message no. 8; log message no. 9."
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "Per SA with eligible rows: exactly one PR; one released PO (per PR, or per PR item if the link is item level); ielp.SA_DETAIL rows exist and match (SA_NUMBER [+ ITEM_NO]); no row with a different non-empty PR / PO. Target rows are never searched by PAS numbers.",
    "children": [
     "log message no. 10; log message no. 11; log message no. 12; log message no. 13."
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "Decision: in the ELIPS transaction lock the target rows and count TOTAL / SAME / CONFLICT.",
    "children": [
     "CONFLICT > 0: log message no. 14. SAME = TOTAL: log message no. 15 (no UPDATE). Otherwise step 7."
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "UPDATE ielp.SA_DETAIL SET PAS_PR_NUMBER, PAS_PO_NUMBER (+ audit columns if they exist) WHERE SA [+ ITEM] AND value empty or equal AND NOT already equal. Rows affected must be TOTAL - SAME, then COMMIT.",
    "children": [
     "Mismatch: log message no. 16. DB error: log message no. 17. Success: log message no. 18."
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "Insert ielp.LOG_ITGPAS (inferred) (UPDATED / NO_CHANGE / SKIPPED / FAILED with reason, PR, PO, SA); continue with the next SA. Waiting states (PR not found / PO not released) only as counts until CB_WAIT_ALERT_DAYS."
   },
   {
    "text": "Update ielp.LOG_ITGPAS (inferred): END_DT, counts, RUN_STATUS SUCCESS / PARTIAL / FAILED; log message no. 19. Unexpected error: log message no. 20."
   }
  ]
 },
