 "func_desc": [
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "text": "DESCRIPTION",
   "num": "4."
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "After PAS budget processing, Auto-PO and Auto-Approval, a scheduled Talend job writes the PAS PR number and the released PAS PO number back to the ELIPS ielp.SA_DETAIL rows of the SA that was sent to PAS (PR_DESC = SA_NUMBER). DB-to-DB, read-only on PAS, no API. Example: PR 5000269261 / PO 4450288442.",
   "level": 1,
   "bold": false
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "4.1 Eligibility (per PAS row)",
   "level": 1,
   "bold": true
  },
  {
   "type": "table",
   "level": 1,
   "columns": [
    {
     "title": "Result",
     "width": 8
    },
    {
     "title": "Condition",
     "width": 37
    }
   ],
   "rows": [
    [
     "PR_NOT_FOUND",
     "No TB_R_PR_H with PR_DESC = SA number (skip, stays pending)"
    ],
    [
     "PO_NOT_RELEASED",
     "No linked PO with status 44 (skip)"
    ],
    [
     "NOTES_EMPTY",
     "PR_NOTES NULL or blank (skip)"
    ],
    [
     "NOTES_NOT_0",
     "RIGHT(RTRIM(PR_NOTES),1) <> '0' (skip)"
    ],
    [
     "ELIGIBLE",
     "Released PO and PR_NOTES ends with '0'"
    ]
   ],
   "row_lines": "all"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "4.2 Identification of the ELIPS rows",
   "level": 1,
   "bold": true
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "a.",
   "text": "Key = SA_NUMBER sent by the forward interface as TB_R_PR_H.PR_DESC; plus ITEM_NO (= TB_R_PR_ITEM.PR_ITEM_NO) when the PO link is item level (OQ-C01).",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "b.",
   "text": "Never search ielp.SA_DETAIL by PAS_PR_NUMBER / PAS_PO_NUMBER; these are only compared (conflict).",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "c.",
   "text": "Exactly one PR per SA and one released PO per PR (or per PR item); otherwise FAILED, not updated.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "4.3 Idempotency / transaction",
   "level": 1,
   "bold": true
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "a.",
   "text": "One ELIPS transaction per SA; rows locked; TOTAL / SAME / CONFLICT counted first.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "b.",
   "text": "SAME = TOTAL: NO_CHANGE, no UPDATE. CONFLICT > 0: FAILED VALUE_CONFLICT, never overwritten (OQ-C10).",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "c.",
   "text": "Rows affected must equal TOTAL - SAME, else rollback. A failed SA does not stop the others.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "d.",
   "text": "Reason codes: PR_NOT_FOUND, PO_NOT_RELEASED, NOTES_EMPTY, NOTES_NOT_0, AMBIGUOUS_PR, AMBIGUOUS_PO, SA_NOT_FOUND, DETAIL_MISMATCH, MULTIPLE_DETAIL_MATCH, VALUE_CONFLICT, PR_MISMATCH, UPDATE_COUNT_MISMATCH, UPDATE_FAILED.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "column_break"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "4.4 Performance",
   "level": 1,
   "bold": true
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "a.",
   "text": "Start from the small ELIPS pending set; query PAS only by PR_DESC IN (chunk) with PO status 44 in the join; no full read of TB_R_PO_H / TB_R_PR_H. Index on TB_R_PR_H.PR_DESC requested (OQ-C08).",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "b.",
   "text": "Mode B (PO-driven, watermark) only if TB_R_PO_H has a change timestamp (OQ-C07).",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "4.5 Context variables",
   "level": 1,
   "bold": true
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "a.",
   "text": "PAS_DB_HOST / PORT / NAME / USER / PASSWORD, ELIPS_DB_HOST / PORT / NAME / USER / PASSWORD (Password type, never logged).",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "b.",
   "text": "CB_PO_RELEASED_STATUS '44', CB_NOTES_SUFFIX '0', CB_LOOKBACK_DAYS, CB_CHUNK_SIZE, CB_USER, CB_WAIT_ALERT_DAYS, CB_MODE.",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "4.6 Critical finding",
   "level": 1,
   "bold": true
  },
  {
   "type": "item",
   "marker": "a.",
   "text": "The current forward interface inserts PR_NOTES = NULL (computed value ends with '1'), so RIGHT(PR_NOTES,1) = '0' never matches unless PAS or the forward interface sets it (OQ-C02).",
   "level": 2
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "4.7 Open questions",
   "level": 1,
   "bold": true
  },
  {
   "type": "table",
   "level": 1,
   "columns": [
    {
     "title": "ID",
     "width": 6
    },
    {
     "title": "Question",
     "width": 39
    }
   ],
   "rows": [
    [
     "OQ-C01",
     "PO-PR relation: table / columns (PO item -> PR_NO + PR_ITEM_NO, or PR on PO header)? One PR -> several POs?"
    ],
    [
     "OQ-C02",
     "PR_NOTES: forward interface inserts NULL (computed value ends '1'). Who sets PR_NOTES ending '0' and what do 0 / 1 mean?"
    ],
    [
     "OQ-C03",
     "TB_R_PO_H: PO status column (44 = Released) and PO number column; data types"
    ],
    [
     "OQ-C04",
     "ielp.SA_DETAIL: SA number / item number columns, PK, audit columns"
    ],
    [
     "OQ-C05",
     "Types / lengths of PAS_PR_NUMBER / PAS_PO_NUMBER"
    ],
    [
     "OQ-C06",
     "PR / PO on ielp.SA_DETAIL vs SA header (SA Monitoring proposal)"
    ],
    [
     "OQ-C07",
     "TB_R_PO_H change / release timestamp for incremental mode B?"
    ],
    [
     "OQ-C08",
     "Index on TB_R_PR_H.PR_DESC; read access for the Talend user"
    ],
    [
     "OQ-C09",
     "ELIPS DB engine; connection per environment"
    ],
    [
     "OQ-C10",
     "Overwrite a different stored PR / PO (PO re-created)? Proposed: no"
    ],
    [
     "OQ-C11",
     "Log tables in ELIPS (proposed) or file / AMC only; who is notified"
    ],
    [
     "OQ-C12",
     "Also set ELIPS SA / daily order status (PO Received)? Not in scope"
    ],
    [
     "OQ-C13",
     "Schedule interval and lookback window"
    ]
   ],
   "row_lines": "all"
  }
 ],
